  "prefLabel": "Ins 2706.06 Methodology for Calculating Qualifying Payment Amount",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 2706.06 Methodology for Calculating Qualifying Payment Amount.\n\n(a) For the purposes of this section, in addition to the definitions set forth in Ins 2706.03, the definitions set out in 45 CFR §149.140(a) shall apply.\n\n(b) The methodology that health carriers or plans shall use for calculation of the median contracted rate shall be as set out in 45 CFR §149.140(b).\n\n(c) The methodology that health carriers or plans shall use for calculation of the QPA shall be as set out in 45 CFR §149.140(c).\n\nSource. #14559, eff 4-22-26, EXPIRES: 4-22-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins2700.html"
